 3 \\times 1800 = 5400\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Total Cost of the Trip**\n\nNow, add the cost of the plane tickets and the hotel:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = \\text{Plane tickets} + \\text{Hotel} = 10,000 + 5,400 = 15,400\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{15400}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 9.568379843141884, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 115, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "2829ef09f61b39752dc7ee5f86854225844b18c4cb049b843fe52a07aa3b2203", "output_tokens": 359, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20526353408, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20841496576, "problem_id": "gsm8k/051ae2b51a5de494/style/explained", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 9607.124110218138}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "15400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 9.607124110218138, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20841496576, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20841496576, "target_calls": 359, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0372026558034122, "turn_index": 0}
